WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.663
Welcome to Krypto Bot.

00:00:01.663 --> 00:00:09.303
In this video, you will set the app up for the first time, make your trading wallet, and learn the one switch that matters most.

00:00:09.303 --> 00:00:10.974
It takes about five minutes.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.551
The first time you open the app, it asks for your language.

00:00:15.551 --> 00:00:17.414
Click yours, then click Continue.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.928
Next is a short summary of the rules.

00:00:20.928 --> 00:00:21.847
Please read it.

00:00:21.847 --> 00:00:26.689
The most important line is the first one: you can lose all the money you trade.

00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:30.366
If you agree, tick the box, then click I agree and continue.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.973
If a friend told you about the app, you can paste their Solana address here.

00:00:35.973 --> 00:00:38.436
If not, leave it empty, and click Continue.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:43.459
This step asks for free keys, from Helius, Birdeye, and Jupiter.

00:00:43.459 --> 00:00:46.521
They make the app faster, but it works without them.

00:00:46.521 --> 00:00:48.994
There is a separate video on getting them.

00:00:48.994 --> 00:00:50.643
For now, click Skip for now.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:54.218
Now the app asks you to set up a wallet.

00:00:54.218 --> 00:00:56.487
This is the wallet the app trades with.

00:00:56.487 --> 00:00:59.978
Use a new wallet just for this app, never your main savings.

00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:01.259
Click Set up a wallet.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:04.546
You are now on your Sol Wallet page.

00:01:04.546 --> 00:01:05.791
Click Generate wallet.

00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:10.542
The app makes a brand new wallet for you, and keeps its key locked on this computer.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:12.381
Important!

00:01:12.381 --> 00:01:15.571
As soon as you have a wallet, the app is in Live mode.

00:01:15.571 --> 00:01:16.870
Live means real money.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:20.710
Click Paper, at the top right, to practise with fake money first.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.309
Switch back to Live only when you are ready.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.261
Next, back up your wallet.

00:01:26.261 --> 00:01:28.812
Scroll down, and click Back up keypair.

00:01:28.812 --> 00:01:29.858
It saves a file.

00:01:29.858 --> 00:01:32.998
Keep that file somewhere safe, like a USB stick.

00:01:32.998 --> 00:01:38.296
If your computer breaks and you have no backup, the money in this wallet is gone.

00:01:38.296 --> 00:01:39.801
Nobody can get it back.

00:01:39.801 --> 00:01:40.586
Not even us.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:45.617
To put money in, send SOL to your deposit address, shown here.

00:01:45.617 --> 00:01:48.298
Start small, with money you are fine losing.

00:01:48.298 --> 00:01:51.588
There is a separate video on deposits and withdrawals.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:53.924
Stuck on anything?

00:01:53.924 --> 00:01:56.091
Go back to the Hub, and open Guides.

00:01:56.091 --> 00:02:01.209
Every part of the app has a short guide there, and all of these videos are there too.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.606
You are all set up.

00:02:03.606 --> 00:02:07.106
Remember: Paper means practice, and Live means real money.

00:02:07.106 --> 00:02:10.787
Back up your wallet before you put money in, and start small.

00:02:10.787 --> 00:02:14.227
And never share your key or your backup file with anyone.

00:02:14.227 --> 00:02:15.735
We will never ask for it.
